> Should I enter the castle through the front door? or should I go in the
> back way by digging down then climbing up?

You cannot dig at the castle level. If you want to enter through the
back door you have to use levitation or water walking to pass the moat.

Whether you enter from the front or rear depends on your equipment and
the castle's residents. Another option is to use a musical instrument
to smash the creatures while they try to reach you coming through the
drawbridge.

